  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/InaugCarolaArt1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(24 fotos) La tarde de este viernes ha abierto sus puertas en la calle San Miguel de Onda, junto al Caf&egrave; del Banc y justo detr&aacute;s del Ayuntamiento, la nueva tienda Carola Art, con la ropa y la bisuter&iacute;a m&aacute;s actuales.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1201.jpg\" alt=\"img_1201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1202.jpg\" alt=\"img_1202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1204.jpg\" alt=\"img_1204\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1205.jpg\" alt=\"img_1205\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1206.jpg\" alt=\"img_1206\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1207.jpg\" alt=\"img_1207\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1208.jpg\" alt=\"img_1208\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1211.jpg\" alt=\"img_1211\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1217.jpg\" alt=\"img_1217\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/innaguraciocarolaart/img_1